ough the JVM and jolt REPL entry points with the standard catalog (output equal line for line), the multiline probe sequence, and the unavailable-library REPL legs (needs bb build:jolt-native)\"\nbb.edn:55:  {:doc \"J5b: the native Python parser's budget (input 4 MiB; in-parser guards: 8192 rule frames, 4096 SLL lookahead links, 256 full-LL links, on a 16 MiB parse thread): the review's repros, at/over per shape against the predicted table, 10x the old crash depths, the JVM's packets (incl. a 20,000-deep 1+ tree), the old crash depths in children on the jolt thread, injected C++ faults, the abort-is-a-failure property, lifecycle and unavailable-library legs. Args select legs: budget below crash inject abort unavailable (needs bb build:jolt-native)\"\nbb.edn:60:  {:doc \"J5b C4 + J5c: build the guards-off calibration variant of native/jolt-parser and record each nesting shape's stack cost per rule frame and per lookahead link on the 16 MiB parse thread (asserting every bound fits a quarter of the stack; writes build/j5b/calibration.edn), or, with --work, the work metric's per-shape counts and the corpus sweep the work bound derives from (writes build/j5b/work.edn; needs bb build:jolt-native)\"\nbb.edn:116:  {:doc \"Fetch (by pinned SHA-256, only when absent) and build the jolt-toolchain.edn :native sources with the mise-pinned CMake into build/native/<platform>/\"\nsrc/dev/jolt_autobahn_testee.clj:99:   deadlines (upgrade, close, unbind) before the cadence.\"\nsrc/dev/jolt_autobahn_testee.clj:131:                   (when (#{:listener-error :upgrade-failed} kind)\nsrc/dev/jolt_j5_acceptance.clj:1:;; bb test:jolt-j5 — the J5 local-REPL acceptance run (docs/design/\nsrc/dev/jolt_j5_acceptance.clj:2:;; yin.repl-jolt-implementation.md §7.8 J5, §10.1 J5 row), end to end through\nsrc/dev/jolt_j5_acceptance.clj:129:  (check \"J5 acceptance: the Python session transcript (standard catalog, (lang :yang/python), arithmetic, definitions across submissions, a multiline function, 